{"step_index":161,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T15:00:11Z","thinking":"**Testing graph properties optimization**\n\nStandard graph families don't reveal a counterexample. Exploring random trees and graphs with large radii is the next step.\nConsider developing an optimizer, either genetic or random mutation-based, specifically to maximize the difference between the radius and the Roman domination number. A non-negative difference would represent a counterexample. Determine the maximum attainable value for this difference.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/.venv/bin/python -c \"\nimport networkx as nx\nfrom graphcalc.graphs.invariants.domination import roman_domination_number\nimport random\n\nbest_val = -999\nbest_g = None\n\n# Optimization to maximize rad - rom\nfor rep in range(1000):\n    n = random.randint(4, 25)\n    # Start with a path or tree\n    G = nx.path_graph(n)\n    # randomly add/remove edges while keeping connected\n    for step in range(50):\n        rad = nx.radius(G)\n        rom = roman_domination_number(G)\n        diff = rad - rom\n        if diff > best_val:\n            best_val = diff\n            best_g = (n, list(G.edges()))\n            print(f'New best diff = {diff} (rad={rad}, rom={rom}, n={n})')\n            if diff >= 0:\n                print('COUNTEREXAMPLE FOUND!')\n                exit(0)\n        # mutate\n        if random.random() < 0.5:\n            # add random edge\n            u, v = random.sample(list(G.nodes()), 2)\n            if not G.has_edge(u, v):\n                G.add_edge(u, v)\n        else:\n            # remove edge if still connected\n            if G.number_of_edges() > n - 1:\n                e = random.choice(list(G.edges()))\n                G.remove_edge(*e)\n                if not nx.is_connected(G):\n                    G.add_edge(*e)\n\nprint(f'Search finished. Best diff found: {best_val}')\n\"","Cwd":"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9","WaitMsBeforeAsync":10000,"toolAction":"Run genetic search","toolSummary":"Run simulated search for rad - rom"}}]}
